<title>TUNISIA: Tunisias foreign reserves rise to 1.80 bln dinars.</title>
<headline>Tunisias foreign reserves rise to 1.80 bln dinars.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisias total foreign exchange reserves were 1.80 billion dinars at December 10, 1996 from 1.77 billion dinars at October 31, Central Bank figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>    TUNISIA RESERVES    Dec 10  Nov 30  Oct 31  Dec 31,95</p>
<p>    Gold and Foreign     1,792   1,801   1,747    1,530</p>
<p>    SDRs			   7	 7	28	 12</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of dinars and subject to rounding.     Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
